          "passageId": "english-pre-a1-m100-reading-passage-01",
          "passage": "Hello! My name is Alex. I live with my family in a small house. I have a sister. We eat food together. I go to school every day. My friend Sam is in my class. We drink water at lunch. I read a book with Sam. I am happy at school. At home, I say, “Thank you!”",
